WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.630
Two pupils give the same speech.

2
00:00:02.680 --> 00:00:05.050
Word for word, it's identical.

3
00:00:05.100 --> 00:00:08.250
During the first one, the
class starts to fidget.

4
00:00:08.300 --> 00:00:11.290
During the second one,
the room goes quiet.

5
00:00:11.340 --> 00:00:12.970
Everyone is listening.

6
00:00:13.020 --> 00:00:14.130
Same words.

7
00:00:14.180 --> 00:00:15.270
Same room.

8
00:00:15.320 --> 00:00:16.950
So what made the difference?

9
00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:18.510
Was it the words at all?

10
00:00:18.560 --> 00:00:21.830
In this mission, you'll practise
three tricks for your voice.

11
00:00:21.880 --> 00:00:24.720
You'll make a point with
a reason and evidence.

12
00:00:24.770 --> 00:00:28.330
You'll build on, or politely
challenge, what others say.

13
00:00:28.380 --> 00:00:32.730
And you'll learn why listening
is part of speaking well.

14
00:00:32.780 --> 00:00:36.270
Your mission: find out
what makes a room listen.
